# tig light colors — GENERATED by theme/generate.sh.
# Edit theme/palette.sh, not this file.
#
# Sourced by .tigrc through the theme-active.tigrc symlink, which
# toggle_theme.sh flips. Only what cannot be shared between the two modes
# belongs here; everything mode-agnostic stays in .tigrc.
#
# The cursor line and the focused view's title bar are the whole of it. tig
# takes colour names and palette indices but no hex, so both resolve through the
# terminal's ANSI ramp — which is exactly why they cannot be shared: ANSI blue is
# pale on dark and strong on light. See ISG_TIG_* in theme/palette.sh for the
# contrast numbers. Both modes declare the same areas so the files stay
# comparable.
color cursor      white blue bold
color title-focus white blue bold
